      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "94",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "des vengeances,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "des vengeances ! fais luire ta splendeur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Élève-toi, juge de la terre ! rends la récompense aux orgueilleux.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jusques à quand les méchants, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! jusques à quand les méchants se réjouiront-ils ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[Jusques à quand] tous les ouvriers d'iniquité proféreront-ils [et] diront-ils des paroles arrogantes ? [jusques à quand] se vanteront-ils ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils foulent ton peuple, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! et affligent ton héritage ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils tuent la veuve et l'étranger, et mettent à mort les orphelins,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et ils disent : Jah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ne le verra pas, et le",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "de Jacob n'y fera pas attention.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Comprenez, vous les stupides d'entre le peuple ! Et vous, insensés, quand serez-vous intelligents ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Celui qui a planté l'oreille n'entendra-t-il point ? Celui qui a formé l'œil ne verra-t-il point ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Celui qui instruit les nations ne châtiera-t-il pas, lui qui enseigne la connaissance aux hommes ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "connaît les pensées des hommes, qu'elles ne sont que vanité.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienheureux l'homme que tu châties, ô Jah ! et que tu enseignes par ta loi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pour le mettre à l'abri des mauvais jours, jusqu'à ce que la fosse soit creusée pour le méchant !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne délaissera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "point son peuple et n'abandonnera point son héritage ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car le jugement retournera à la justice, et tous ceux qui sont droits de cœur le suivront.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui se lèvera pour moi contre les méchants ? Qui se tiendra avec moi contre les ouvriers d'iniquité ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'avait été mon aide, peu s'en serait fallu que mon âme n'ait été habiter dans le silence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si j'ai dit : Mon pied glisse, ta bonté, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.94.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.94.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! m'a soutenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dans la multitude des pensées qui étaient au-dedans de moi, tes consolations ont fait les délices de mon âme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le trône d'iniquité, qui fait de l'oppression",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "une loi, sera-t-il uni à toi ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils se rassemblent contre l'âme du juste, et condamnent le sang innocent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.94.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.94.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 94:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
